WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:06.160
A growing web of rail road and sea routes is at the core of

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.280
Beijing's foreign policy strategy. From China to Southeast Asia

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.480
Central Asia the Middle East Europe and Africa the Belt Road

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.200
initiative is a huge global project expanding and integrating

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.240
infrastructure networks which President Xi Jinping has called

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.440
the project of this century .

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.680
Welcome to Mombasa. Traders have been coming to Kenya's oldest

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:42.120
city for centuries. The Arabs the Portuguese the British and

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:46.160
Indians have all tried their hand at making a fortune here. 

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:50.840
The latest are the Chinese. We'll explore that grandiose ambitions

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:54.920
asking whether dreams in far off Beijing match those on the

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:59.120
African continent. I'm Rishaad Salamat. This is Belt Road .

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:01.120
China's trade superhighway .

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:19.560
Mombasa is seen as the gateway to East Africa. At least five

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:23.280
landlocked nations including Uganda and Rwanda rely on this port

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:27.720
to get goods in and out. The Mombasa and Nairobi Standard Gauge

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:31.360
Railway or SGI is the nation's biggest infrastructure project

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.240
since independence from Britain in 1963 .

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:39.080
Kenya paid three point eight billion dollars. 

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:42.920
China arranged the financing and built what is the start of a rail network that

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:46.600
promises to open up the passage of people and goods deep into

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:48.040
the heart of the continent .

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:53.360
Yes. Jack RTS journey to Kenya's capital to five hours down for

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:56.280
more than eight for cargo transported by truck

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:03.320
The Belt Road initiative is I believe a good initiative for for the region .

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:09.000
The railway link from Mombasa to Nairobi.

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:14.040
 I have reservations about the price that was paid for the rail link. 

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:21.080
However the fact that we have a rail link now is creating immense opportunities

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:26.680
leading to a reduction in supply lead times and so on. 

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:27.520
That's what we wish for. 

